# 统一换行符：源码与配置文件一律 LF，避免 Windows 上编辑后产生 CRLF 噪音提交。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 以下类型必须保持二进制，禁止做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary

# lockfile 不参与 diff 折叠，保持原样
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
